          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193354_990588_24383"/>
          <body> the word or set of words describing the requirements that are covered by both the base part and the alternate part and therefore are the basis for the statement regarding the capability of replacing the base part by the alternate part. &lt;note&gt; Additional properties such as performance, noise, endurance, or reliability may also be considered as a prerequisite for the replacement in addition to form, fit, function, and quality.&lt;/note&gt; The value of this attribute need not be specified. </body>
        </ownedComment>
