        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_290014c_1523621774061_203613_119117"/>
        <body>The mapping of DefinitionBaseOccurrence has two alternatives. See the other alternative when the Occurrence is defined by a ProductConfiguration. </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_2_8db01ea_1456216819938_186154_42984" xmi:uuid="a4b06bdb-4716-4436-b80f-6921c5433bb9" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193064_750412_23505"/>
        <body>A DefinitionBasedOccurrence is a type of Occurrence that uses a PartView or a ProductConfiguration as its definition. It is either a SingleOccurrence or a QuantifiedOccurrence.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>DefinitionBasedOccurrence</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193569_135502_26037" xmi:uuid="f658bd02-bf9c-4768-a1cd-9dbf8ce06c55" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
