    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193285_662638_23909" xmi:uuid="35c7a025-35d4-4f39-8c57-4ac95c93a0a3" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_290014c_1549042465105_512505_133833" xmi:uuid="24263073-9277-4ac0-85dc-1de1800c39a7" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_290014c_1516891368570_306392_87761"/>
        <body>As an opposite of Descriptor, the Language_indication is created for each alternative parametric, so there are 2 instances at the end.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_290014c_1549041163228_686438_132518" xmi:uuid="a310f463-ef2d-4cf0-9c31-bb8a5418d0db" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_290014c_1516873196759_220954_82693"/>
        <body>This property is the same as the one displayed in the alternative 1 diagram ViewContext_alt1_mapping. As there is only one Descriptor instance coming from the Domain, which creates only one instance of Description_text_assignment ARM object, such CombienViews constraint is needed to assigned both target to the description element.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_290014c_1517826591778_800919_102130" xmi:uuid="bd3190d2-7b7c-4f25-95bd-4c8a31fcfab5" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <body>ViewContext in the Domain model can either be an Initial_view_definition_context or an Additional_view_definition_context or both. The mapping sorts out those which can only be initial or those that can only be additional, based on enumeration elements in the applicationDomainSelector. Those that can be either are mapped to both. The AdditionalViewContext mapping copies elements from the InitialViewContext mapping and applies them to an Additional_view_definition_context. The key factor on which is produced is the outputs of applicationDomainSelector.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1526652344343_479038_227911" xmi:uuid="be8b838d-e1ce-4774-b1d4-48250ee33a16" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_2_attr_SYSML_ARM-Initial_view_definition_context-views"/>
        <body>Inverse attributes do not need to be mapped</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_290014c_1524072206471_626136_154521" xmi:uuid="cc6cbf88-e3f6-4b76-b18c-50e2c22ba175" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <body>In ViewContext you will either get an initial_view_context, or an additional_view_context or both. In the Occurrence mapping you will only ever get one of the subtypes. This is because the concepts are modelled differently for ViewContext in the Core/Domain level to the ARM level. The Domain model approach can be found at the AIM level where a context can be used as initial or additional and not have separate instances to represent the same context used in two different ways. The case of Occurrence object is different, as only one Definition can exist, thus a re-selection constraint is used to have only one output port at the end.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455717252840_290976_42956" xmi:uuid="cea43edb-c503-4ab6-a163-420e510d346a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193285_662638_23909"/>
        <body>A ViewContext is a grouping of an application domain and a life-cycle stage. It identifies a universe of discourse suitable for the description of parts. &lt;note&gt; Requirements and vocabularies vary among the industrial activity fields. This entity intends to identify such domains. &lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>ViewContext</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194114_502168_29172" xmi:uuid="155b52f0-391e-4575-a8b5-265fefe804de" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1721295758510_882989_151274" xmi:uuid="39777e52-0017-44c8-8fa6-97bec21295fb" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1721295758510_151517_151275" xmi:uuid="08d8500b-9d2d-4249-ba2a-3adb302a159b" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body> &lt;sch:rule context="//ViewContext[@uid]"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="entity_name" value="if(@xsi:type) then substring-after(@xsi:type,':') else name()"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="adRef" value="if(ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef and //ApplicationDomain[@uid and @uid = ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString) then //ApplicationDomain[@uid and @uid = ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString else ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="lcsRef" value="if(LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef and //LifeCycleStage[@uid and @uid = LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString) then //LifeCycleStage[@uid and @uid = LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString else LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="ad" value="if(ApplicationDomain/ProxyString) then ApplicationDomain/ProxyString else if(if(ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef and //ApplicationDomain[@uid and @uid = ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString) then //ApplicationDomain[@uid and @uid = ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString else ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef) then if(ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef and //ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain[@uid and @uid = ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString) then //ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain[@uid and @uid = ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString else ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef else ()"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="lcs" value="if(LifeCycleStage/ProxyString) then LifeCycleStage/ProxyString else if(if(LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef and //LifeCycleStage[@uid and @uid = LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString) then //LifeCycleStage[@uid and @uid = LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString else LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef) then if(LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef and //LifeCycleStage[@uid and @uid = LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString) then //LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage[@uid and @uid = LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString else LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef else ()"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="not(//ViewContext[@uid and (if(ApplicationDomain/ProxyString) then ApplicationDomain/ProxyString else if(if(ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef and //ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain[@uid and @uid = ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString) then //ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain[@uid and @uid = ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString else ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef) then if(ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef and //ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain[@uid and @uid = ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString) then //ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain[@uid and @uid = ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString else ApplicationDomain/ApplicationDomain/@uidRef else ()) = $ad and (if(LifeCycleStage/ProxyString) then LifeCycleStage/ProxyString else if(if(LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef and //LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage[@uid and @uid = LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString) then //LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage[@uid and @uid = LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString else LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef) then if(LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef and //LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage[@uid and @uid = LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString) then //LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage[@uid and @uid = LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef]/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString else LifeCycleStage/LifeCycleStage/@uidRef else ()) = $lcs and @uid != $uid])"&gt; The combination of the ApplicationDomain and the LifeCycleStage shall be unique. { -entity_name:&lt;sch:value-of select="$entity_name"/&gt; -entity_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt; -rule_name:UR1 -attribute_name:ApplicationDomain, LifeCycleStage -attribute_values:&lt;sch:value-of select="$ad"/&gt;, &lt;sch:value-of select="$lcs"/&gt; -references:&lt;sch:value-of select="$adRef"/&gt;, &lt;sch:value-of select="$lcsRef"/&gt; } &lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1513327450593_542369_64594" xmi:uuid="bd33171f-f737-4d72-ac96-19cdc8d7f593" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194114_502168_29172"/>
          <body>the combination of the ApplicationDomain and the LifeCycleStage shall be unique. </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671466883785_931682_163156" xmi:uuid="da80c068-f16e-4282-b00e-66a2a1dfe78c" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671466893909_686887_163157" xmi:uuid="8371b6ec-6790-4608-a5c0-1b0a1f550cb0" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>UR1: ApplicationDomain, LifeCycleStage;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>EXPRESS</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>UR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193285_662638_23909"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194836_705601_35389" xmi:uuid="0b1ee491-2e14-4b03-9fa0-c62338a351af" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>ViewContext::allInstances() -&gt;isUnique(Sequence{ApplicationDomain, LifeCycleStage})</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_90c01d7_1631783579554_830884_93936" xmi:uuid="f59499f8-5ddb-4680-bff0-751c3d46f6c8" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1721295758502_574741_151272" xmi:uuid="0c145f5c-74ac-410e-8a13-72df981b6777" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1721295758503_963819_151273" xmi:uuid="f6ec58c6-057c-43ee-ae52-10aaf746f8fd" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body> &lt;sch:rule context="//ViewContext[@uid]"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="entity_name" value="if(@xsi:type) then substring-after(@xsi:type,':') else name()"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="(count(//*/InitialContext[@uidRef = $uid]) != 0) or (count(//*/AdditionalContexts/ViewContext[@uidRef = $uid]) != 0)"&gt; A ViewContext shall be used at least once by a PartView through either of the attributes AdditionalView or InitialView. { -entity_name:&lt;sch:value-of select="$entity_name"/&gt; -entity_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt; -rule_name:WR1 } &lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_90c01d7_1631783622107_252865_93938" xmi:uuid="e2f50027-b724-46b5-8a3c-746575d17d7e" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_90c01d7_1631783579554_830884_93936"/>
          <body>a ViewContext shall be used at least once by a PartView through either of the attributes AdditionalView or InitialView.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193285_662638_23909"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_90c01d7_1631783579557_903569_93937" xmi:uuid="d32b5df3-cbd1-4b6c-b2c8-140ba4499c61" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>not(self.InitialView.oclIsUndefined()) or not(self.AdditionalView.oclIsUndefined())</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513962331155_789232_114893" xmi:uuid="06c74f60-732d-44d7-a1de-139e3a3accef" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
