        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193152_975164_23677"/>
        <body>A NextAssemblyViewUsage is a type of AssemblyViewRelationship that is a relationship where the attribute Related specifies a view of an assembly and the attribute Relating specifies a view of the immediate parent assembly of the constituent.</body>
