        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193023_111351_23407"/>
        <body>An AssemblyViewRelationship is a type of PartViewRelationship. An AssemblyViewRelationship is the relation between an AssemblyDefinition and a PartView representing a view of the assembly. The AssemblyDefinition and the PartView shall share at least one ViewContext.</body>
      </ownedComment>
