      <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_290014c_1596559529737_583033_98667" xmi:uuid="a86e1af2-9886-4358-baac-436be30827f4" xmi:type="uml:Class">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1598631003431_714405_90694" xmi:uuid="7d48d006-9631-40df-9560-06ea6f76b5df" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_290014c_1596559529737_583033_98667"/>
          <body>A transformation to enable the mapping from the Domain to the ARM. The transformation is defined in the OCL constraint code.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>TransformationMatrixToPairOfPlacement</name>
        <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_290014c_1596559529749_811850_98669" xmi:uuid="29053c85-de96-4578-a861-cc3d86d780b7" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_290014c_1599061594698_531485_89508" xmi:uuid="a5dfdf11-dcde-4f88-ace0-19cf3bf2166e" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_290014c_1596559529749_811850_98669"/>
            <body>This constraint is populating axis placements' locations and directions from the cartesian transformations' translation and rotation matrix. In 3D space, according to P42, the ref direction is the local X axis, and the ref direction is the local Z axis. In 2D space, according to P42, the ref direction is the local X axis NOTE: for the source axis placement, coordinates (0,0,0) and no rotation are used.</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>output</name>
          <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_290014c_1596559529737_583033_98667"/>
          <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_290014c_1596559529749_573706_98670" xmi:uuid="3d10c8a3-90cc-4363-8ed0-47d80b4dc5b1" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
            <body>if rotation_in-&gt;size() &gt; 2 then source_out.location.coordinates = Set{0.0,0.0,0.0} and target_out.location = translation_in and source_out.ref_direction = null and source_out .axis = null and target_out.ref_direction = rotation[1] and target_out.axis = rotation[3] else source_out.location.coordinates = Set{0.0,0.0} and target_out.ref_location = translation_in and source_out.ref_direction = null and target_out.ref_direction = rotation_in[1] endif</body>
            <language>OCL2.0</language>
          </specification>
        </ownedRule>
        <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_290014c_1596559788599_415581_98727" xmi:uuid="9dc775c2-1cc5-40b4-9365-7b964f683b09" xmi:type="uml:Port">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1676133303860_252996_173863" xmi:uuid="5ddc5a9b-9fcb-44b1-aa09-052387bf1922" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_290014c_1596559788599_415581_98727"/>
            <body>the output source Axis_placement.</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>source_out</name>
          <visibility>private</visibility>
          <type href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_SYSML_ARM-Axis_placement"/>
          <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_290014c_1596561203109_365454_100047" xmi:uuid="7ee35f6f-35b5-4914-91b7-a72ae5aca27b" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
          <isReadOnly>true</isReadOnly>
