            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_290014c_1515340686882_753882_168483"/>
            <body>if input is undefined then set cartesianTransformation2d to null, if input is of type CartesianTransformation and input.cartesianTransformation is of type Cartesian_transformation_2d then set cartesianTransformation2d to input.cartesianTransformation, otherwise set it to null. </body>
