    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193111_30242_23589" xmi:uuid="ad365dcb-ddee-4aca-acce-f79ab42c7f7b" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455714112948_966968_42865" xmi:uuid="513ed688-adbb-4ecc-af9e-5c8a4d1370dc" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193111_30242_23589"/>
        <body>A GeometricalRelationship is the relationship between two PartViewRelationship objects specifying two parts that are geometrically related. Therefore, the shape of the related parts may be represented only once and can be reused for the geometrically related situation. In this case the shape of the relating PartView is derived from the shape of the related PartView. The two PartViewRelationship objects that are related by this relationship shall belong to different PartVersion objects. Other properties except shape are not subject to this relationship and therefore are not 'inherited' from the related PartView to the relating PartView. &lt;example&gt;The Figure &lt;caption&gt;Mudguard illustration of GeometricalRelationship&lt;/caption&gt;shows an example for a GeometricalRelationship: in this case the left mudguard of a car is symmetrical to the right mudguard. A given plane mirroring transformation specifies the location of the left mudguard regarding the location of the right mudguard.&lt;/example&gt; &lt;figure&gt;&lt;name&gt;geometricalrelationship.png&lt;/name&gt;Mudguard illustration of GeometricalRelationship&lt;/figure&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>GeometricalRelationship</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193708_5332_27094" xmi:uuid="322d3064-409e-446d-9f99-824ac7de69ec" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193173_498774_23718"/>
      </generalization>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193708_795511_27095" xmi:uuid="d8cfd69b-2447-4ea1-bf44-e06644ffc1a6" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455714202388_667455_42866" xmi:uuid="7becee60-afad-4dd6-aad1-0f5c7e4faccd" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193708_795511_27095"/>
          <body>the CartesianTransformation or the GeometricRepresentationRelationship that defined a placement transformation consisting of rotation and translation to be applied to the related PartView in order to define the location and the orientation within the context of the relating PartView. Translation, rotation, and mirroring, i.e., inversion, is included; scaling is not included.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Placement</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193275_408791_23889"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193708_189395_27093"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1547135402552_560085_105307" xmi:uuid="5c5f007a-f48a-44fd-b21b-f22be77e705b" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1547135402553_608130_105309" xmi:uuid="7efefec9-6065-4c5d-9ceb-c94feb0083d1" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1547135402552_560085_105307"/>
          <body>the inherited attribute RelationType. The value of relationType shall be 'geometrically related part view'.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>RelationType</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../../../../DataTypes.xmi#STRING"/>
        <defaultValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1547135449200_994716_105313" xmi:uuid="c4ffc1de-3870-4d6b-ad5a-f4908d4b59ae" xmi:type="uml:LiteralString">
          <value>geometrically related part view</value>
        </defaultValue>
        <redefinedProperty xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193889_502917_28117"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
