      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193800_833905_27632" xmi:uuid="a7f2853b-89f3-433e-aff3-1f102936e3ad" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455714252991_637020_42868" xmi:uuid="3e047f14-b104-43d3-8b0b-4f4c82802575" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193800_833905_27632"/>
          <body> the object or set of objects held externally to the exchange file for which this object is a proxy. Where applicable the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'design': The concerned item belongs to the design phase of the life cycle; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;'manufacturing': The concerned item belongs to the manufacturing phase of the life cycle; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;'support': The concerned item belongs to the support phase of the life cycle; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;'recycling': The concerned item belongs to the recycling phase of the life cycle; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;'not specific': The object is considered as not specific of any life-cycle stage.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>SameAs</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
