          <body>specifies the PartClassSelect objects of the Part. &lt;note&gt; The partTypes is used to distinguish a part in the Bill of Material (BOM).&lt;/note&gt; &lt;note&gt; For the attribute id a set of predefined values is specified hereafter. If values other than the proposed ones are used, they should be of general categorizing nature. This kind of categorization ought not to be used to classify names or identifiers of objects such as to classify part families; for this purpose ought to be used.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;note&gt; A Part shall always be categorized as 'piece part', 'product', 'software', 'tool', or 'raw material'.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
