    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193255_976317_23859" xmi:uuid="e2f9ce08-c11a-4c52-b167-6609c6231b27" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455717136674_611857_42954" xmi:uuid="c334bcac-44c0-406b-8659-c3542057c6cb" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193255_976317_23859"/>
        <body>A SpecifiedOccurrence is a mechanism to identify a certain Occurrence in a multi-level assembly structure that reuses partial decompositions. &lt;example&gt;A 'chassis' consists among others of the sub-assemblies 'front axle' and 'rear axle'. Both axle assemblies consist, among others, of the 'left wheel' and the 'right wheel'. In order to identify the 'left wheel' of the 'rear axle', the SpecifiedOccurrence object references 'left wheel' as definition, and 'rear axle' as upperUsage.&lt;/example&gt; A SpecifiedOccurrence is a type of Occurrence.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>SpecifiedOccurrence</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193847_161338_27865" xmi:uuid="3c239a1b-9d07-4e2b-9b21-391e51139de4" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193154_583949_23682"/>
      </generalization>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194080_251121_29013" xmi:uuid="1b884708-3392-4911-a38c-82285210abd6" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_2_8db01ea_1456148354684_516727_42732" xmi:uuid="7d683c50-0b0a-4651-a7d7-35781c93086a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194080_251121_29013"/>
          <body>the Occurrence that is to be identified for an immediate upper level Occurrence.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Definition</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193154_583949_23682"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193847_119755_27869"/>
        <redefinedProperty xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193849_301983_27879"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194081_483520_29014" xmi:uuid="109f44c8-8916-401b-b024-a705f8da8466" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_2_8db01ea_1456148664938_130636_42733" xmi:uuid="4879ef78-c98c-48e9-9cee-7e83a7ccf73e" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194081_483520_29014"/>
          <body>the Occurrence in which the Definition Occurrence is used. This Occurrence shall be the immediate upper level instance or another SpecifiedOccurrence of the immediate upper level instance. </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>UpperUsage</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
