    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193248_774437_23848" xmi:uuid="ee49bc6d-402f-4791-b0a4-c5046c3bc2c5" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455717095884_807759_42953" xmi:uuid="906383b7-95d3-4829-bf77-580154010f04" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193248_774437_23848"/>
        <body>A SingleOccurrence is a subtype of DefinitionBasedOccurrence It is one specific occurrence of an object that is defined either as a PartView, or as a ProductConfiguration. &lt;note&gt;A SingleOccurrence may or may not be associated with placement information using an OccurrencePlacement. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;example&gt;In a TechnicalSolution for the 'front left brake', a 'brake disk' is used and its position is specified by a geometric Transformation.&lt;/example&gt; A SingleOccurrence is a type of Occurrence.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>SingleOccurrence</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193569_456491_26040" xmi:uuid="2180b527-5bab-44a9-bbbc-ae5239f79aef" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
